= Background <prop_background>

== Usability Guidelines

A common standard for good usability are Nielsen's heuristics @nielsen10UsabilityHeuristics2024. Another established standard are the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) @WebContentAccessibility, which are an international standard that is explicitly referenced in EU norm 301 549 (TIDO: cite).

@amershiGuidelinesHumanAIInteraction2019 proposes guidelines specifically for human-AI interaction. @ledoEvaluationStrategiesHCI2018 summarize and compare different evaluation strategies for HCI toolkits.

== Usability In Software Projects

@lageUsabilityTechnicalDebt2019 did a multi-case study about usability technical debt in software projects, outlining the context and nature of usability aspects that typically contribute to this debt.
As for the process of improving usability in softwares, @llerenaHowImproveUsability2025 offer a review of evaluation techniques and proposals on how to adapt them to an open-source software (OSS) context.

